  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Leo. You're verified, and you're right on both points.\n\n- **The app's \"delivered\" status was wrong.** The courier's app marked the order delivered at 6:58 PM, but the courier was still 2.1 miles from your address. The courier actually reached you and handed the order over in person at 7:47 PM.\n- **The order was 47 minutes late.** It was promised for 7:00 PM.\n\nBecause it was 45 or more minutes late, I've added **$5.60 in account credit**. That's 20% of your $28.00 food subtotal. It's in your balance now and you can use it on a future order.\n\nLate deliveries are compensated with account credit only, so I can't refund the card for this. If anything was missing or wrong in the order, tell me and I'll look into that too."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Ok, thanks. Credit is better than nothing, I suppose. The order was fine, nothing missing. Still, the app said it was delivered at 7 and I was standing at the door for 45 minutes. A credit for a burger I ate cold doesn't make up for that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry, Leo. Waiting at the door for 45 minutes while the app said the order had arrived is frustrating, and the burgers arriving cold made it worse.\n\nThe late-delivery policy sets the compensation for this, and I've already applied it in full. I can't add more credit or refund the card. Nothing else in the order qualifies, since nothing was missing or wrong.\n\nIf you'd like a person to review your case, I can pass it to a specialist, who will follow up within 24 hours. Would you like me to do that?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Yeah, go ahead and pass it on. I'd rather someone look at the fact that the app said delivered at 7 when the courier was still two miles away. Can you tell me the case number so I have it?"
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "name": "escalate_to_human",
   "args": {
    "customer_id": "D202",
    "reason": "customer_request",
    "order_id": "Q-7201",
    "summary": "Customer Leo Brandt's order Q-7201 was handed off at 7:47 PM, 47 min after the 7:00 PM promise. The courier app marked it delivered at 6:58 PM while 2.1 miles from the address. Standard late credit of $5.60 (20% of subtotal) already issued. Customer is unhappy with the outcome and asks for a person to review the false delivered status. No items missing or wrong."
   },
   "result": {
    "escalation_id": "ESC-700",
    "follow_up": "within 24 hours"
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've passed your case to a specialist. Your reference number is **ESC-700**. They'll follow up within 24 hours. I can't say what the outcome will be.\n\nThe summary I sent includes the false 6:58 PM \"delivered\" status, the courier being 2.1 miles away at that point, and the 47-minute delay. It also notes that the $5.60 credit is already on your account.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Nope, that's it. Thanks for passing it on. I'll wait to hear from them, though I'm not holding my breath."
  }
